OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Ainvestigate juror and check his phone
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe defence lawyer for a Massachusetts
OL,7,Fmother accused of murdering her three
OL,8,Fchildren has asked a judge to
OL,9,Finvestigate a juror in the case.
OL,11,FThe proceedings against Lindsay Clancy
OL,12,Fended in a mistrial and acrimony this
OL,13,Fmonth after the jury failed to reach a
OL,14,Funanimous verdict.
OL,16,FHer attorney, Kevin Reddington, wants
OL,17,Fthe court to probe mobile phone use by
OL,18,F"Juror Doe" during deliberations as
OL,19,Fwell as a questionnaire he filled out.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
