OL,3,ALindsay Clancy's lawyer asks judge to
OL,4,Ainvestigate juror and check his phone
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lawyer for Michael Desronvil, the
OL,7,Flone juror who wanted to find Clancy
OL,8,Fguilty, said the latest defence motion
OL,9,Fwas a "Looney Tunes" attack on his
OL,10,Fclient for doing his civic duty.
OL,11,FDesronvil has said there was "enough
OL,12,Fproof that she [Clancy] knew exactly
OL,13,Fwhat she was doing".
